prompt_template:
Create a native {ASPECT_RATIO} flat-ink manga illustration of an adult night worker. The image is captured through a true circular 180-degree fisheye, with huge lens-touching foreground and violent barrel distortion, not an illustration surrounded by a decorative border.
{STYLE_FIDELITY_ANCHORS}
Hero: {SUBJECT}
Specific comedy: {SUBJECT_ACTION}
Dense setting: {LOCATION}
Placement and ratio: {DESIGN_DIRECTION}
Teal, coral, cream and black. Keep the face/hand about one third of the entire frame or larger. Make the world visibly wrap around the lens edge; outside the actual optical image is dark. Keep dense scene content but draw it with simple flat cells and hard black ink like references R2/R3. No primary text.
Exclude: {SOURCE_CONTENT_TO_AVOID}
